  "interpretation": [
    "Native target-size output geometry was 2048x1080 for both high-resolution sources.",
    "The target path still reads and entropy-decodes the complete compressed source packet; it does not skip 4K/6K compressed data.",
    "On this host, 4K-to-2K is only just above 24 fps at p95 before color conversion, upload, scheduling, and present; 6K-to-2K is below real-time 24/25 fps.",
    "This benchmark demonstrates functional target-size reconstruction, but not production-ready 4K/6K-to-2K playback performance."
